             :retrieved "2026-08-11"}
   :licence {:id  "CC0-1.0"
             :url "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"
             :established
             "The ScienceBase catalogue item carries a machine-readable rights field, read on
2026-08-11 from https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/696a75d5d4be0228872d3bf8?format=json —
\"This work is marked with the Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0) public domain
dedication; https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/.\" That per-item dedication is
